# Dynamic arrays in synthesizable code

- Source URL: https://github.com/pulp-platform/redundancy_cells/issues/17

[Dynamic arrays](https://github.com/pulp-platform/redundancy_cells/blob/master/rtl/hsiao_ecc/hsiao_ecc_pkg.sv#L16) are probably not supported for RTL synthesis. [Synopsys DC](https://iis-git.ee.ethz.ch/github-mirror/carfield/-/jobs/997337#L429) and [Vivado](https://iis-git.ee.ethz.ch/github-mirror/carfield/-/jobs/997386#L4381) both complain.

